ding-relaxed\">Real-time visual cues guide users through any workflow, step by step.</p></div><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-accent/10 rounded-2xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden\"><video src=\"/PH.mp4\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\"></video></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div></div></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2dbtb_-trigger-autopilot\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_R_2dbtb_-content-autopilot\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none space-y-6\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Activate Users. Transform Your Product.</h2><p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Drive adoption by solving user problems in real-time while uncovering the insights that build a better product.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 relative\"><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"text-left mb-10\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4 transition-colors duration-300\">Slash Your Support Costs</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Empower users to find answers and complete tasks on their own. Solving queries in-app before they become tickets.</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-50 sm:h-80\"><img alt=\"Customer support automation illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover rounded-lg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2FS2_I1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute left-1/3 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/20\"></div><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"text-left mb-10\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4 transition-colors duration-300\">Double User Activation</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Eliminate the learning curve and drastically reduce time-to-value. Convert new sign-ups into engaged, paying customers faster ever.</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-50 sm:h-80\"><img alt=\"Activation rocket illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover rounded-lg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FS2_I2.jpg&amp;w=1200&a