-bold mb-4 text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Powerful Intelligence. Effortless Control.</h2></div><div class=\"text-right justify-end\"><p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Get a real-time view of how users interact with your software</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 relative\"><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary/80 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-code w-8 h-8 text-primary-foreground\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4l4 4\"></path><path d=\"M17 8l4 4l-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M14 4l-4 16\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold text-card-foreground transition-colors duration-300 mb-4\">Integration</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-300\">Embed our lightweight agent with a single line of code. No complex SDKs.</p></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-border\"></div><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent to-accent/80 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-palette w-8 h-8 text-accent-foreground\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 0 1 0 -18c4.97 0 9 3.582 9 8c0 1.06 -.474 2.078 -1.318 2.828c-.844 .75 -1.989 1.172 -3.182 1.172h-2.5a2 2 0 0 0 -1 3.75a1.3 1.3 0 0 1 -1 2.25\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 10.5m-1 0